Package: openmediavault-qnap
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8),
         python3 (>= 3.9),
         smartmontools,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qnap8528-dkms
Suggests: qm2mod-dkms
Description: OpenMediaVault QNAP hardware plugin
 Fan control, status LED, front panel brightness and power recovery
 settings for QNAP NAS devices (e.g. TS-253D) running openmediavault.
 .
 Needs the open source qnap8528 embedded controller driver
 (qnap8528-dkms, released alongside this package) and, for QM2 cards,
 qm2mod-dkms.
